abstract: >-
  Code of a longitudinal evaluation of when and how to update personalized glucose
  forecasters in type 1 diabetes: a leakage-free day-by-day simulator, staged screening
  of refit policies and update mechanisms, confirmation under pre-specified rules in
  several public datasets, and the analyses and figures of the companion articles.
  No patient data are included; the datasets are requested from their sources.
keywords:
  - type 1 diabetes
  - glucose forecasting
  - continual learning
  - model updating
  - concept drift
  - personalization
